* ''Codex seats carry even the critical path'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Continue, use Codex seats even for critical paths (then Sol+Opus reviews)"//). A critical-path or seam lane runs on Codex seats; while the pool stands above a lead seat's ceiling, Codex build seats edit the lane's worktree (network off) and the lane's conductor reads each diff and commits it; every such slice takes a Sol read and a blind Opus read before land.

